ights </span><span begin="01:42.650" end="01:43.160">when </span><span begin="01:43.160" end="01:43.700">I </span><span begin="01:43.700" end="01:44.540">feel </span><span begin="01:44.540" end="01:45.350">alone</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.350" end="01:48.350"><span begin="01:45.350" end="01:45.770">Needed </span><span begin="01:45.770" end="01:46.250">someone </span><span begin="01:46.250" end="01:46.400">to </span><span begin="01:46.400" end="01:46.970">talk </span><span begin="01:46.970" end="01:48.350">to</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.620" end="01:52.670"><span begin="01:48.620" end="01:49.040">'Cause </span><span begin="01:49.040" end="01:49.190">I </span><span begin="01:49.190" end="01:49.490">just </span><span begin="01:49.490" end="01:49.700">need </span><span begin="01:49.700" end="01:49.850">to </span><span begin="01:49.850" end="01:50.330">get </span><span begin="01:50.330" end="01:52.670">through</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.290" end="01:56.570"><span begin="01:54.290" end="01:54.590">And </span><span begin="01:54.590" end="01:54.770">l've </span><span begin="01:54.770" end="01:54.860">been </span><span begin="01:54.860" end="01:55.340">spending </span><span begin="01:55.340" end="01:55.370">a </span><span begin="01:55.370" end="01:55.730">lot </span><span begin="01:55.730" end="01:55.850">of </span><span begin="01:55.850" end="01:56.360">money </span><span begin="01:56.360" end="01:56.570">on</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.570" end="01:59.000"><span begin="01:56.570" end="01:57.410">things </span><span begin="01:57.410" end="01:57.680">that </span><span begin="01:57.680" end="01:57.950">I </span><span begin="01:57.950" end="01:58.370">don't </span><span begin="01:58.370" end="01:59.000">need</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.000" end="02:02.420"><span begin="01:59.000" end="01:59.570">Hoping </span><span begin="01:59.570" end="01:59.900">that </span><span begin="01:59.900" end="02:00.080">I'll </span>